      "fontSize": 12.5,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "diamond = version DAG (double arrow = derives/merges) · inside each box: the STATE — solid → parent, dotted ⤍ next-sibling,\nparent above, siblings share a row (leftmost = row head = the child no sibling points to) · the two worlds differ ONLY in the\ntimestamp of B’s dead g₁ (2 vs 6), which no final state records",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
